window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Corrupting angels should be fun. But damn it. It’s more soul-crushing and infuriating work than I expected. Especially when Lucifer, a.k.a. Lucian, is a lying sack of demon guts and would much prefer to rule Hell alone.</p> <p>Yeah...no. That doesn’t work for me. If he gets his way and I fail, I’ll lose my soul. I’ll lose my chance at helping the Seven Sinners of Hell’s Kingdom to rise with me taking the throne of Purgatory.</p> <p>And unfortunately, Lucian’s not my only problem. One of the angels who was supposed to jump and create a new level of Hell as its ruler has already fallen from grace. He’s mortal and bound to a bottom-feeder demon. How the hell am I supposed to complete my mission for my soul when the universe is out to get me? I guess I’ll find out.</p> <p>Four more thrones that must be claimed, and my current collection of devils needs me to fill them to secure our eternities. I can’t let them down.</p> <p>Plus, I’m not a big fan of being Lucifer’s little toy forever. He’s not my type of psycho. He should be the one to bow to me.</p>"; 
